sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Client App
    participant API as Server
    participant DB as Database

    U->>UI: Enter URL, client_id, password

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
    Note over UI,API: Registration
    UI->>API: GET /parameters
    API-->>UI: 200 {P, G}
    UI->>UI: x = scrypt(password, salt) mod Q
    UI->>UI: y = G^x mod P
    UI->>API: POST /register {client_id, secret_y=y}
    alt New client_id
        API->>DB: INSERT user(client_id, secret_y)
        DB-->>API: OK
        API-->>UI: 201 {status: Registered}
        UI-->>U: Registered successfully
    else client_id already exists
        API-->>UI: 409 {reason: already registered}
        UI-->>U: Error - already registered
    end
    end

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over UI,API: Login - Commit Phase
    UI->>API: GET /parameters
    API-->>UI: 200 {P, G}
    UI->>UI: x = scrypt(password, salt) mod Q
    UI->>UI: r chosen uniformly from [1, Q-1] via CSPRNG
    UI->>UI: t = G^r mod P
    UI->>API: POST /login/commit {client_id, commitment_t=t}
    alt user not found
        API-->>UI: 404 {reason: user not registered}
        UI-->>U: Error - user not registered
    else t not a valid subgroup member
        API-->>UI: 422 {reason: invalid commitment}
        UI-->>U: Error - invalid commitment
    else active session already exists
        API-->>UI: 409 {reason: existing commitment found}
        UI-->>U: Error - start a new session
    else all checks pass
        API->>DB: SELECT secret_y WHERE client_id=?
        DB-->>API: {secret_y}
        API->>API: session_id = CSPRNG(32 bytes)
        API->>API: binding = SHA-256(addr|UA|session_id|client_id|t)
        API->>API: c = int(binding) mod (P-2) + 1
        API->>API: sessions[session_id] = {t, c, binding, created_at}
        API-->>UI: 200 {challenge_c, session_id}
    end
    end

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over UI,API: Login - Verify Phase
    UI->>UI: s = (r + c * x) mod Q
    UI->>API: POST /login/verify {solution_s=s} <br/> X-Auth-Session: session_id
    break session_id not found in store
        API-->>UI: 404 {reason: invalid session_id}
    end
    break created_at + TTL less than now
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 401 {reason: session expired}
    end
    break s out of range [0, Q)
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 422 {reason: invalid solution}
    end
    API->>API: binding' = SHA-256(addr|UA|session_id|client_id|t)
    break binding' != stored binding
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 401 {reason: session binding mismatch}
        Note right of API: Relay or MitM detected
    end
    API->>API: c' = int(binding') mod (P-2) + 1
    break c' != stored c
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 400 {reason: challenge integrity check failed}
        Note right of API: Session field tampered
    end
    API->>DB: SELECT secret_y WHERE client_id=?
    DB-->>API: {secret_y=y}
    API->>API: Check G^s == t * y^c mod P
    alt proof valid
        API->>DB: INSERT AuthToken(JWT, client_id, issued_at)
        DB-->>API: OK
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 200 {token}
        UI-->>U: Authenticated - JWT stored
    else proof invalid
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 401 {reason: verification failed}
        UI-->>U: Error - unauthorized
    end
    end

    rect rgb(245,255,245)
    Note over UI,API: Authenticated Request
    UI->>API: GET /data  Authorization: Bearer {token}
    API->>API: Decode and validate JWT signature and expiry
    alt valid token
        API->>DB: SELECT personal_data WHERE client_id=?
        DB-->>API: {data}
        API-->>UI: 200 {data}
        UI-->>U: Display result
    else invalid or expired token
        API-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
        UI-->>U: Error - unauthorized
    end
    end

    Note over API: Every response carries security and tracing headers